---
// Site-wide override of Starlight's Banner: every page shows the
// deprecation notice. revcat is superseded by RevenueCat's official CLI.
---

<div class="deprecation-banner" role="note" data-pagefind-ignore>
	<strong>revcat is deprecated and no longer maintained.</strong>
	Please use the official RevenueCat CLI:
	<a href="https://github.com/RevenueCat/cli">github.com/RevenueCat/cli</a>
</div>

<style>
	.deprecation-banner {
		padding: var(--sl-nav-pad-y) var(--sl-nav-pad-x);
		background-color: var(--sl-color-orange-low);
		color: var(--sl-color-orange-high);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-orange);
		line-height: var(--sl-line-height-headings);
		text-align: center;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}
	.deprecation-banner a {
		color: inherit;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>
